    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d510">

                <pb facs="0457" n="341" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg341"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 838.00/865.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Minister Smith to the
                            Secretary of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegrams.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Port au Prince</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-03-03">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">March 3, 1914</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The Department’s March 1. President Zamor received me formally this morning.
                    Capt. Russell and Commander Bostwick also present.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Smith</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
